ut we must do static evidence: read the actual handler chain.\n\nPriority: Since we need command injection and memory corruption with call chain & PoC, and dynamic verification via qemu trace harness (HTTP GET), httpd is the most traceable: binary httpd md5 9582aa23..., argv [\"-f\"] etc., port 80, request_path e.g. \"/cgi/...\" Let me figure out httpd argv from /etc/init.d or rcS scripts in firmware. Let me browse etc.\n\nLet me do:\n1. get_duid (dhcp6s 0x40f1d0) full + sub_40F168 (0x40f168) full — command injection check.\n2. sub_425CB8 (httpd 0x425cb8) full.\n3. fw_browse_firmware etc dir listing + www dir listing.\n4. AS-AUTH-002 (vsftpd), AS-AUTH-003 (scp), AS-AUTH-005 (uclited) — later.","stream":true,"block":0}

