data: {"seq":307,"ts":"2026-08-22T16:18:43.379Z","text":"The env list is a generic list; 17 callers. The request parser that fills a1+32 with query params — likely somewhere in sub_420... or the httpRequest init (callers of httpGenListCreate include the one that creates the request env list). This rabbit hole could go deep without direct coverage.\n\nTime to wrap up. Let me assess the minidlnad stuck trace one final time; the slot is stuck. I should tell the user about it.\n\nAlso — one thing I haven't tried: `fw_request_frida` — for x86 only; firmware is MIPS. Skip.\n\nFINAL DECISION on findings:\nPer discipline and per user's conditional instruction (\"拿到 qemu 差分或 fuzz 结果后再决定是否入库\"):\n- httpd 登录/命令注入：qemu 差分 = 0（两次，带 trace_id ef55266d1f34、2ba400f78c44），触发均为 ConnectionReset，无法证明登录路径可达，也不构成漏洞证据 → 不入库。\n- fuzz：infra 编译失败（fz-2f3b8931，mips hook 编译错）→ 无法提供 fuzz 证据。\n- 高分静态路径逐一核验后：\n  * dhcp6s sub_40F0F8（vsprintf+system）：调用者 get_duid/sub_40F168 只传常量字符串，输出到 /dev/ttyS0，非网络可控 → 不构成 CWE-78/CWE-134，不入库（避免假阳性）。\n  * xl2tpd start_pppd：execv argv，非 system；且 xl2tpd 被识别为 not-public → 不入库。\n  * libavformat ff_udp_set_remote_url/udp_open 的 memcpy(ai_addrlen)：长度来自 getaddrinfo（16/28B），非攻击者可控 → 不入库。\n  * httpPwdDecode / httpLineUnescape / DHCPv6 选项解析（dhcp6_get_options、sub_40CBA8、sub_40D3D4）：均有边界检查 → 未发现可利用缺陷。\n\nSo the honest deliverable: 无确认漏洞入库；附工作证据清单、被排除的高分路径和原因、可复现 PoC 草案（httpd 登录请求、DHCPv6 触发报文）作为后续验证输入。\n\nHmm, but the user's instruction tone (\"继续挖掘\") suggests they want me to keep pushing. Let me make one more targeted attempt that could actually yield a real dynamic diff: **usc/uhttp? No. What about radvdctl/dnsproxy?** — trace harness needs HTTP GET; only HTTP-speaking daemons can produce diffs. minidlnad is HTTP-speaking but stuck.\n\nActually — wait. Is the minidlnad run *really* stuck, or did it finish with status still showing running due to a hang? Let me poll once more; if still running, I'll give it up.\n\nAlso, let me reconsider: maybe I can test a **different httpd a